  <h2>The Healthcare Copywriting Framework</h2>

  <p>
    Healthcare content follows a consistent pattern:
  </p>

  <ol>
    <li><strong>Acknowledge the fear</strong> — Patients are anxious. Name it.</li>
    <li><strong>Educate without overwhelming</strong> — Explain what they need to know, not everything you know.</li>
    <li><strong>Demonstrate expertise through empathy</strong> — Show you understand their situation.</li>
    <li><strong>Make the next step easy</strong> — Low-commitment CTAs work better for healthcare.</li>
  </ol>

